| Documentation accessible on the WIKI page:                                        |
| ------------------------------------------                                        |
| https://wikis.univ-lille.fr/phlam-hpc/                                            |
|                                                                                   |
| New commands to check the status of the cluster:                                  |
| ------------------------------------------------                                  |
| cnodes           : to list the status of all nodes                                |
| cnodes -f        : to check for free nodes                                        |
| checkjob <jobid> : to check the status of your job (especially when not running ! |
| showstart <jobid>: to check when your job is expected to start when not running ! |
| cdjob <jobid>    : to move to the <jobid> directory                               |
| cdtmp <jobid>    : to move to the <jobid> working directory on node               |
| rmtmp <jobid>    : removing the <jobid> working directory on node                 |
|                                                                                   |
